  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "What Affects the Cost of Interior Lighting Upgrades in San Diego County?",
    "text": "What Affects the Cost of Interior Lighting Upgrades in San Diego County?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "The right interior lighting upgrade depends on room function, ceiling construction, existing circuits, desired control, fixture quality, and whether the work is part of a larger remodel. A fixture-only replacement may be limited in scope, while new recessed lighting, relocated switches, added circuits, or ceiling changes can require broader electrical coordination and permitting review.",
